<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(By the end of this module, you will master the essentials of Conversion Rate Optimization \(CRO\). You'll understand the CRO process, including observation, ideation, testing, and deployment. Dive deep into each component, such as heuristic analysis, data analysis, hypothesis creation, testing, and decision-making. You'll also gain insights into best practices and receive a CRO checklist for practical use.)/Alt()/Pg 30 0 R/K[20]>>
